RESEARCH TOOL — NOT FOR CLINICAL DIAGNOSIS.

LabSentinel is a research-grade decision-support tool. It is not FDA-cleared,
CE-marked, or approved for clinical use. It must not be used as the sole basis
for any clinical decision. All outputs must be interpreted by a qualified
clinician in the context of the full patient history.
